- Version:    1.2.1 (tagged release; saved under the name centres-cli-1.2.1.jar)
- Download:   https://github.com/SiMolecule/centres/releases/download/1.2.1/centres.jar
- SHA-256:    6c5d5cafa9393ed7b667a2340222348cd15a9bbdd0d1b92518229f26cc5e87fb
- Size:       2,291,742 bytes; Main-Class com.simolecule.centres.LabelCip
- License:    BSD-2-Clause (centres itself; Copyright (c) 2020, John Mayfield).
              As a shaded jar it also bundles, in binary form:
                * CDK (Chemistry Development Kit) — LGPL-2.1-or-later
                  (source: https://github.com/cdk/cdk)
                * javax.vecmath — GPLv2 with the Classpath exception
                  (source: https://github.com/hharrison/vecmath)
